// gamebuilder.org's module for every page but /agents (issue 30): the page (web/page.coax: the home
// page's ring of game types, the login, the world and the builder, a published game's link, the
// credits) with /agents left out (web/agents-off.coax), so the home page's first load is the page and
// nothing more. /agents is web/site-agents.coax's module: the same page with the chat with your agents
// (web/agents.coax). web/build.sh makes this build/site.wasm, the module the page's script loads
// (web/app.js; web/keep.js gives /agents its own).
//   scripts/web.sh           dev server with hot reload, http://127.0.0.1:8810/
//   scripts/web.sh check     this module's checks (the page's) and /agents' (web/site-agents.coax)
//   coax/bin/coax test web/site.coax --library

#load "page.coax";
#load "agents-off.coax";
